# ROVEXO Owner Preview Certification v1.0 (CANONICAL FREEZE · OWNER APPROVED)

Aligned with **Owner Preview Policy v3.0**.

## Mission

The official Owner URL must be: **PUBLIC · HTTPS · MOBILE ACCESSIBLE · 24/7 · OWNER TESTABLE · RESPONSIVE · STABLE**.

**If the Owner cannot open the URL from their phone, it is not ready for approval.**

## Official URL

**https://www.rovexo.co.uk** — SSOT `lib/preview/owner-preview-ssot.ts`

## Certification gates (all required)

1. DNS PASS  
2. HTTPS PASS  
3. PUBLIC ACCESS PASS  
4. MOBILE PASS (iPhone · Android · Safari · Chrome Mobile · Tablet · Desktop)  
5. OWNER ACCESS PASS  
6. RESPONSIVE PASS  
7. FUNCTIONAL / NAVIGATION PASS  
8. OWNER VISUAL APPROVAL  

## Forbidden as official

localhost · HTTP-only · invalid/expired/inaccessible URLs · temporary / per-module previews · multiple official URLs · screenshots-only approval

## Freeze gate

Until Owner has successfully tested on the official URL: **no Freeze · Commit · Push · Deploy · Production Certification**.
